WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 7.1 · Brand, Identity & Image
Brand, marketing and communications

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Your brand is what people will expect from you; your image is what they think of you today.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Separate brand, identity, image and communications.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Start from what early contacts say about your idea.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Build trust through consistent experience, not a logo.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You describe your early image and the brand you want.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
